preset    MiseLayout
formats   json
envs      dev (from /home/me/.config/myapp/myapprc.json)
platform  unix, linux, linux-x64

scopes:
  defaults  Defaults  system   selected
  system    FixedDir  system   selected
  user      FixedDir  user     selected
  project   Walk      project  selected
  override  FixedDir  user     selected
  env       EnvVars   user     selected

bootstrap:
  user  loaded  /home/me/.config/myapp/myapprc.json  json

layers:
  defaults  loaded     (defaults)
  system    loaded     /etc/myapp/config.json              json
  user      duplicate  /home/me/.config/myapp/config.json  json           loaded at a higher position through the project scope
  user      loaded     /home/me/.config/myapp/config.json  json
  project   loaded     /home/me/work/myapp.json            json
  project   empty      /home/me/work/myapp.dev.json        json, env dev
  env       loaded     (env)

bindings:
  MYAPP_CEILING_PATHS              CEILING_PATHS              not set
  MYAPP_CONFIG_DIR                 CONFIG_DIR                 not set
  MYAPP_CONFIG_FILE                CONFIG_FILE                not set
  MYAPP_CONFIG_FORMATS             CONFIG_FORMATS             not set
  MYAPP_ENV                        ENV                        not set
  MYAPP_GLOBAL_CONFIG_FILE         GLOBAL_CONFIG_FILE         not set
  MYAPP_IGNORED_CONFIG_PATHS       IGNORED_CONFIG_PATHS       set
  MYAPP_OVERRIDE_CONFIG_FILENAMES  OVERRIDE_CONFIG_FILENAMES  not set
  MYAPP_SYSTEM_CONFIG_DIR          SYSTEM_CONFIG_DIR          not set
  MYAPP_SYSTEM_CONFIG_FILE         SYSTEM_CONFIG_FILE         not set

warnings:
  unknown-key  password (set by /home/me/.config/myapp/config.json) matches no field
